    LLM: 'Game: Chiva. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Chiva: Caribbean domino game (e.g. Puerto Rico). Four players in fixed partnerships; double-6 set. Play by matching ends; doubles crosswise. Team wins by scoring 4 or 6 times in a row (characteristic Caribbean style).',
    objective: 'Win a set number of rounds in a row (e.g. 4 or 6) as a team. Opponent score resets your count.',
    gameplay: 'Match touching ends; doubles at right angles. If you cannot play, pass. Round ends when a player empties hand or game is blocked. Winning team scores 1 (or 2 with key tiles); first team to target consecutive wins takes the game.',
